Reproduced defect: with the cloud unreachable but the device save succeeding, the
repair detail pill showed 「未保存」 while the page banner said 「この端末に保存」.
The candidate mapped the workspace-level cloud error onto save.error, which the
detail treats as "not saved". The existing Editor chip distinguishes these
states (device saved + cloud pending vs device save failed), so the repair pill
now follows the same rule: only a device-cache failure is 未保存; the cloud
error is carried separately as cloudError.

--- a/src/main.jsx
+++ b/src/main.jsx
-  const repairSave = { status, error: sync.cacheFailed ? '端末に保存できません。' : error, retry, sync, session }
+  const repairSave = { status, error: sync.cacheFailed ? '端末に保存できません。' : '', cloudError: error, retry, sync, session }
